WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The alarm clock is placed in the workspace.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
The robot waits without pressing the visible button.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
[The alarm begins ringing.] The robot detects the acoustic trigger and moves toward the clock.

00:24.000 --> 00:31.416
The robot presses the button after the alarm has begun.
